'''Coal''' is a {{Common}} crafting ingredient, brewing ingredient, and fuel source, found in the {{Zone|Coal Mine}}, {{Zone|Gold Mine}}, {{Zone|Gunpowder Mines}},  {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}, {{Zone|Crystal Hollows}} and {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}.

== Collection ==
Collecting pieces of Coal increases the player's Coal [[Collections|Collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of pieces of Coal.

{{/Collection UI}}
{{CollectionTable|Coal}}

== Obtaining ==
=== Mining ===
{{Item|Coal Ore}} and {{Item|Pure Coal}} can be mined to obtain '''Coal'''.

=== Mob Drops ===
{{Drop Sources}}

=== Minions ===
'''Coal''' can be obtained from {{Item|Coal Minion}}s, or from [[Wood (disambiguation)#Minions:|Wood Minion]]s with the {{Item|Auto Smelter}} upgrade applied.

=== Trading ===
{{Trades Table
|input1=Oak Log
|output1=Coal,2
}}

=== Shop Purchase ===
'''Coal''' can be purchased from {{NPCSprite|Mining Merchant}} for {{c|4}}, up to 640 per day.

