== Usage ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Usage}}

=== Furnace Fuel ===
'''Coal''' can be used as fuel in {{Item|Furnace}}s.

=== Minion Fuel ===
'''Coal''' increases minion speed by {{Green|5%}} for 30 minutes. {{Affected Minions List|fuel|all}} 

=== Brewing ===
'''Coal''' can be used to brew {{Item|Haste Potion}}s.

== Trivia ==
* The item description is frequently changed, rendering some Coal not stackable. This can be fixed by dropping old Coal on the floor or switching lobbies to update all the items to the latest description.

